<Slide style={{ background: '#F5F1E6', padding: '40px 64px', fontFamily: '宋体' }}>
  <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'flex-end', height: 72, position: 'relative', zIndex: 5 }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 40, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1F3A34', lineHeight: 1.15 }}>接龙怎么接</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, color: '#6B6B6B' }}>示范</Text>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ height: 472, marginTop: 20, flexDirection: 'column', position: 'relative', zIndex: 5 }}>
  <Box style={{ height: 472, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 30, color: '#1F3A34', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>乡下人离不了泥土</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 26, color: '#B4552D', marginLeft: 14 }}>↓ 因为</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 30, color: '#1F3A34', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>种地是最普遍的谋生办法</Text>
    <Box style={{ marginTop: 26, borderLeft: '4px solid #B4552D', paddingLeft: 22 }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 26, color: '#1F3A34', lineHeight: 1.8 }}>每一句先压成一个短句</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 26, color: '#1F3A34', lineHeight: 1.8 }}>箭头里填“因为 / 所以 / 但是 / 于是”</Text>
    </Box>
  </Box>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ height: 40, marginTop: 12, borderTop: '1px solid rgba(31,58,52,0.2)', flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center', paddingTop: 8, position: 'relative', zIndex: 5 }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, color: '#6B6B6B' }}>《乡土中国》· 第 2 课时</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, color: '#B4552D' }}>06/17</Text>
  </Box>
